WEBVTT

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.000
Unleash your creativity and shape
the future of design with QC Design School.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.800
Together, we can transform your passion
into a dynamic, thriving career.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.960
With a 40-year legacy, QC Design School
has helped over 45,000 students and graduates

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.400
launch successful design careers
around the world.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.280
Your design journey starts
wherever you are.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.000
Learn anytime, anywhere with
our immersive online platform.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.440
Our courses are led by industry professionals
who share real-world insights and strategies.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.360
Hone your skills with real-world projects.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.800
Master space planning, color theory,
and stay ahead with the latest industry trends.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:01.280
Join a vibrant community and enjoy
real support every step of the way.

00:01:02.079 --> 00:01:05.920
Connect with peers, access exclusive
expert-led workshops,

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:09.000
and get detailed guidance
from QC student advisers.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.200
Graduate with a globally
recognized certification.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.000
Unlock endless career opportunities.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.200
The world needs your vision.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.600
Enroll today and transform your passion
into a rewarding career.
